Package: namegender
Type: Package
Title: Client for the NameGender API
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("NameGender", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@namegender.com")
Description: Query names, email addresses and usernames, and the country
    distribution of a name, through the NameGender API. Run CSV and XLSX
    files as file jobs, and verify the signature of NameGender webhooks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, httr2, openssl, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://namegender.com/docs, https://github.com/anpekesen/namegender-r
BugReports: https://github.com/anpekesen/namegender-r/issues
